{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>The ה of הלוא אנכי אתנך</b> — plene with vav. Six things she said to him. \"For loading alone, for riding alone\" — as stated in the first chapter of Avodah Zarah, page 4a." "<b>רכבת עלי</b> in gematria: רבעתני"], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {0 "The comment parses the verse's plene spelling (הלוא written with vav) as hinting at six statements the donkey made to Balaam; the Aramaic phrase לטעינה בעלמא אקראי בעלמא (\"for loading alone, for riding alone\") refers to the six things enumerated in Avodah Zarah 4a."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:53.590604643Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}